&lt;li&gt;Skill in managing and leading change initiatives within the finance function.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated commitment to staying informed and driving improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated commitment to continuous learning and driving improvement within Finance and the broader organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the business model and how packaging, monetization, and usage policies tie into overall business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
