&lt;li&gt;Comfortable challenging customers and internal Product/Engineering teams constructively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong curiosity and ability to learn and communicate emerging technologies, particularly across AI, data and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence and credibility without needing to have previously held a CTO or equivalent executive technology position.&lt;/li&gt;
