&lt;h1&gt;Security &amp;amp; Compliance Analyst&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Become a Security &amp;amp; Compliance Analyst at Bloomreach. You will join our Governance, Risk, and Compliance team and help maintain our compliance activities, resolve compliance-related issues, and support engineering and sales teams with customer requirements. Bloomreach provides the best digital experience for leading international e-commerce companies, and your work will help protect the trust of hundreds of millions of consumers who shop online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your tasks and responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Security &amp;amp; Compliance Analyst, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support periodic audits of company procedures and processes, and help prepare reports on compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate compliance issues, document findings, and support the implementation of appropriate actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the sales process by completing security and compliance sections of RFPs and customer questionnaires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help ensure that policies, standards, and related documentation are reviewed and kept up to date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the security training program.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain process mapping and the responsibilities structure chart.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support updates to compliance policies and related documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research relevant regulations, standards, and industry developments to support the team’s work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help communicate applicable regulations and compliance requirements to internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with the preparation of management reviews and supporting materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate with clients across different regions, including EMEA and the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we expect from you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of relevant industry compliance requirements and standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good understanding of SaaS businesses and how they operate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good understanding of Governance, Risk, and Compliance in an IT environment.&lt;/li&gt;
