&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We facilitate sports, yoga, and meditation opportunities for each other.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
